│   ├── recover-pod-startup-failure.md               ★★★★★  【故障处理】排查 CrashLoopBackOff
│   ├── recover-service-connectivity.md              ★★★★★  【故障处理】恢复 Service 通信
│   ├── recover-ingress-routing.md                   ★★★★★  【故障处理】恢复 Ingress 路由
